                                "sense_id": "919b088f-ca25-3de5-b1cc-5879fdb4855b",
                                "text": "1839 Thomas Carlyle, from letter quoted in Thomas Carlyle; a History of the First Forty Years of His Life by James Anthony Froude\nI am no man whom it is desirable to be too close to — an unhappy mortal — at least, with nerves that preappoint me to continual pain and loneliness."
                            },
